# Home worlds architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/home-worlds.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/home-worlds.md).

**Permanent decision:** after Character Create, new players choose a **home
world**. Choice binds Star System + primary body + starter station family
(Hab). Initial three: **Asteron** (temperate rocky), **Virelia** (gas giant /
floating cities, no land terrain), **Korrath** (volcanic / extreme heat).
Sticky at create. Starting Hab resolves from `homeWorldId`. Death fallback
respawn uses home Hab — [Player death](../../docs/docs/architecture/player-death.md).
Entry hop: [Scene flow](../../docs/docs/architecture/scene-flow.md).
Primary body recipe: [Planets](../../docs/docs/architecture/planets.md).

When changing home-world offers, signup select, or starter Hab binding, read
the full doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
